// MissionControl — the zero-tool project-refinement conversation behind a Project's Mission
// Control (43.20 task 2).
//
// It is deliberately NOT a small Janus. It has one expert, no `role: agent`, and its runner is
// invoked with no tool declarations, so it cannot request a tool, touch a file, or run a command.
// Its whole job is to help a person sharpen what their Project is for. Starting implementation
// work is a separate, explicitly named run launched from the Project's selected launch mission.

mission MissionControl(projectGoal, task) = {
    Controller
}

output(MissionControl)
